  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EXECUTION OF R&apos;KIZ LAKE PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT OF AN AREA OF 1,000 HA IN A DEPRESSED AREA IN THE SOUTH OF MAURITANIA THROUGH IRRIGATION FROM A TRIBUTARY OF THE SENEGAL RIVER. THE PROJECT WILL INCREASE THE AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTION AND WI WILL HELP THE LOW INCOME RURAL FAMILIES.</narrative>
  </description>
